{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1790158682","published":"2026-09-23T10:18:13Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:40.145268721Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-49975"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-49975","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service via an unbounded number of HTTP/2\n     request header lines\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-49975.patch: add the max_headers directive\n       (default 1000) and enforce it in ngx_http_process_request_headers() and\n       ngx_http_v2_state_process_header(), so a client can no longer drive\n       unbounded per-request header-list growth over HTTP/2; the counter is\n       appended to the end of struct ngx_http_request_s (not inside\n       ngx_http_headers_in_t, which is embedded by value and would shift every\n       later request field) and max_headers to the end of\n       ngx_http_core_srv_conf_t, so every existing field offset is preserved\n       and prebuilt third-party dynamic modules stay ABI-compatible\n     - CVE-2026-49975","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-auth-pam?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-0ubuntu1.7+tuxcare.els8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1790158682.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-cache-purge?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-0ubuntu1.7+tuxcare.els8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu20.04els/CLSA-2026-1790158682.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:20.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libnginx-mod-http-dav-ext?distro=ubuntu-20.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTE